
Tracing level reset from 0 to 1.

Solving sin(30 + x) = cos(45 + x) for x

Tidying to sin(30 + x) + -1 * cos(45 + x) = 0

Expanding and collecting terms gives

-1 * sin(x) * (-1 * sin(45) + cos(30)) + ((1/2) + -1 * cos(45)) * cos(x) = 0

tan(x) = - (cos(30) * -1 + sin(45)) / (cos(45) * -1 + (1/2)) 

	Letting n1 denote an arbitrary integer
    x = arctan(((1/2) + -1 * cos(45)) ^ -1 * (-1 * sin(45) + 1 * cos(30))) + 180 * n1
